<title>GERMANY: Romania D-mark Eurobond to have 5-yr maturity.</title>
<headline>Romania D-mark Eurobond to have 5-yr maturity.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romanian central bank governor Mugur Constantin Isarescu said on Wednesday that Romania's planned mark-denominated Eurobond will have a five-year maturity.</p>
<p>&quot;The issue will be rated BB- (Standard &amp; Poor's) and BA3 (Moody's) and will have a five-year maturity,&quot; Isarescu told a news conference.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
